From: Kimmy <yucheng.or@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:29:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Refresh string diff fixture for go-diff 1.4

The current go-diff library changes the ANSI reset boundaries around whitespace without changing the resulting edit. Refresh the exact output fixture while preserving the assertion and the remaining differ tests.

Upstream: https://github.com/aphistic/sweet
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 differ_test.go | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/differ_test.go b/differ_test.go
index 8a62b58..1feb481 100644
--- a/differ_test.go
+++ b/differ_test.go
@@ -79,8 +79,8 @@ Diff
     <string>: 
     [31m    [0mthis
     [32m	[0mis[32m	[0m
-    		a[31m
-    [0m[32m	[0mstring[31m?[0m[32m
-    	[0m
+    		a[31m[0m
+[31m    [0m[32m	[0mstring[31m?[0m[32m[0m
+[32m    	[0m
 `))
 }
